<par def='1'><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Here is the outline of the changes that were made to all the Hecs Order Tracking systems, let me know if you have any questions.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>1 - added a GST profile document where the administrator can modify the GST tax as he pleases. This can be done from the Admin section. See image.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='9pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
